  unitName: Boreal Courage Karl
  unitId: 20236
  unitNumber: 1219
  description: A Unit modeled after Karl, a Summoner belonging to the Akras Summoners'
    Hall. He gained the ability to use his demonic powers freely by acknowledging
    the demon blood that flows through his veins and accepting the power within it
    as part of himself. However, if the words of one of his demonic father's closest
    aides are to be believed, Karl's powers are even greater still. His latent powers
    sparked both excitement and apprehension among the ranks of the Summoners' Hall.
  summonDesc: Now, let's get moving buddy!<br>Nothing scares me if we're together.<br>I
    can live my life<br>the way I'm meant to!
  fusionDesc: I won't deny myself any longer.<br>For the friends who believed in
    me,<br>I will accept my demonic powers!
  evoDesc: The source of my powers is demonic.<br>And what's wrong with that?!<br>I
    am Karl, a Summoner of the<br>Akras Summoners' Hall!
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
